OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA clear and chilly start with
OL,6,Ffrost in rural spots inland, chance of
OL,7,Fshowers along the coast. Cloud
OL,8,Fgradually thickens throughout the day,
OL,9,Frain and stronger winds arriving by
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FOvercast with rain, moderate
OL,13,For heavy at times, spreading eastwards
OL,14,Facross the whole of the region by the
OL,15,Fmorning. Winds will strengthen and
OL,16,Flocally blustery along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
